{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_201_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_201","textTraditional":"一、二十有一年。春王三月，葬蔡平公。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_201_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_201","textTraditional":"二、夏，晉侯使士鞅來聘。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_201_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_201","textTraditional":"三、宋華亥、向甯、華定自陳入于宋南里以畔。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_201_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_201","textTraditional":"宋南里者何？若曰因諸者然。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_201_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_201","textTraditional":"四、秋七月壬午朔，日有食之。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_201_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_201","textTraditional":"五、八月乙亥，叔痤卒。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_201_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_201","textTraditional":"六、公如晉，至河乃復。","sentenceOrder":7}],"overrides":{}}